<http://data.silknow.org/object/66dc86ce-ca4f-3a0f-86da-6b76bfeb2733/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "A man’s summer suit, comprising coat, waistcoat and breeches, made of beige silk taffeta.  The coat has a 1-inch (2.5 cm) standing collar, and curving two-piece sleeves ending in a 3½-inch (9 cm) cuff.  The fronts curve from neck to hem with 3¼-inch (8.3 cm) pleats below the hip set at the side back.  Each front has a pocket with scalloped pocket flap; the centre-back seam is open below the hip.  The coat is unlined; exposed seams are backstitched and felled. The fronts are faced, and the skirts, collar and pocket flaps lined with carnation-pink silk taffeta, the pockets with bleached linen.    There are 10 worked buttonholes along the left front and 10 corresponding buttons, covered with beige silk and thread on the right, 1 at the top and 1 at the hem of the pleats.\n\nThe waistcoat is made of beige silk taffeta with a round neck, curving fronts, skirts reaching between the middle and top of the thigh and curving 2-piece sleeves.  Each front has a pocket and scalloped pocket flap.  The waistcoat is unlined; exposed seams are backstitched and felled.  The fronts and cuff openings are faced, and the skirts and pocket flaps lined with carnation-pink silk taffeta. There are 12 worked buttonholes along the left front and on each sleeve; 12 corresponding silk and thread-covered buttons on the right front and 1 on each sleeve.  \n\nThe breeches comprise 2 fronts, two backs and 2 waistbands, made of beige silk taffeta.  The back legs are cut higher than the fronts and gathered into the back of the waistbands.  There is a watch pocket in the lining of the right front waistbands.  The fronts close with buttoned waistbands and a fall front; the back waistbands with eyelets.  The breeches are unlined; exposed seams (except the outside leg) are backstitched and felled.  There are 2 silk and thread-covered buttons on the waistband, 1 on each front side, corresponding to 2 buttonholes on the waistband and 3 on the fall front.  Five buttons and buttonholes fasten each outside leg, with a knee-band below."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/66dc86ce-ca4f-3a0f-86da-6b76bfeb2733> .

